 "method": "each setting the CLI offers on the Settings page, read through the CLI and through an independent JSON-RPC oracle that opens the page as the web client does (a new res.config.settings); set to another value through the CLI, read back by both, then restored through the CLI and read back. A value Odoo refuses through the CLI is saved through the page itself: refused there too, the setting agrees. Setting names, statuses and hashes only; every setting was put back.",
